WEBVTT

01:30.900 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.070 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 20]

01:39.640 --> 01:40.590
How weird.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.430
Does he have any enemies?

01:43.430 --> 01:43.950
Yes.

01:44.430 --> 01:45.950
He has a grudge against this man.

01:45.950 --> 01:46.640
Gu Pingwen,

01:47.039 --> 01:48.300
how could you say that?

01:49.590 --> 01:50.450
Your Highness,

01:50.590 --> 01:52.460
I'm merely serving

01:52.560 --> 01:53.350
as the humble head

01:53.350 --> 01:55.680
of the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

01:55.789 --> 01:57.479
There used to be some misunderstandings

01:57.479 --> 01:58.680
between Mr. Gu and me.

01:58.710 --> 02:00.380
But ever since he earned

02:00.400 --> 02:02.040
the reputation
as the Top Tea Under Heaven,

02:02.040 --> 02:03.410
it has brought great honor

02:03.410 --> 02:05.740
to our Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

02:05.780 --> 02:06.890
I-I feel nothing

02:06.920 --> 02:08.630
but sincere gratitude toward him.

02:08.630 --> 02:10.289
How could I possibly hurt him?

02:10.400 --> 02:10.870
Mr. Gu Pingwen,

02:10.870 --> 02:12.430
you shouldn't talk nonsense like that.

02:12.430 --> 02:13.290
Your Highness,

02:13.560 --> 02:14.360
I have already dispatched

02:14.360 --> 02:15.470
all the tea merchants

02:15.470 --> 02:17.480
from the Anhui Association in the capital

02:17.480 --> 02:18.360
to search everywhere

02:18.360 --> 02:19.710
for Mr. Gu.

02:19.780 --> 02:20.640
Your Highness.

02:24.870 --> 02:27.000
I'm putting you
in charge of finding this person,

02:27.000 --> 02:28.150
so that when the Empress Dowager

02:28.150 --> 02:29.960
asks me about it,
I will have something to say.

02:29.960 --> 02:30.690
Understood.

02:32.910 --> 02:33.960
The Empress Dowager

02:33.960 --> 02:36.020
likes your Orchid Snow tea very much.

02:36.150 --> 02:37.360
Prepare 2 baskets of tea.

02:37.360 --> 02:38.120
I'll send someone

02:38.120 --> 02:39.280
to collect them later.

02:39.280 --> 02:39.800
Also,

02:40.630 --> 02:41.680
when you find your brother,

02:41.680 --> 02:43.190
tell him to send a message to my mansion.

02:43.190 --> 02:44.120
I wish to see him.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.610
Farewell, Your Highness.

02:55.710 --> 02:56.590
Mr. Gu, Mr. Gu.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.680
Go away.

03:01.630 --> 03:02.310
Mr. Gu,

03:03.430 --> 03:04.190
I think

03:05.430 --> 03:06.750
you should hurry

03:07.240 --> 03:08.520
to get the tea ready.

03:09.470 --> 03:10.560
You can totally entrust

03:10.560 --> 03:12.290
Mr. Gu Pingyuan's matter to me.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.680
Entrust it to you?

03:14.310 --> 03:15.310
Had you not been constantly

03:15.310 --> 03:16.520
bullying my brother and me,

03:16.520 --> 03:18.120
would he have suffered this?

03:18.480 --> 03:20.210
It's been so many days already.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.000
Mr. Gu,

03:22.470 --> 03:24.030
just do me

03:24.360 --> 03:25.240
a favor,

03:25.400 --> 03:26.000
please...

03:26.750 --> 03:29.280
It's the tea
that the Empress Dowager asks for.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.710
This is no trivial matter.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.570
Oh my goodness.

03:31.840 --> 03:32.870
Hurry up.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.079
Go.

03:44.680 --> 03:45.310
Hou Er!

03:46.740 --> 03:47.400
Coming!

03:47.560 --> 03:48.090
Come out!

03:48.190 --> 03:48.990
Old Master Hu!

03:50.800 --> 03:52.400
What's wrong, Old Master Hu?

03:52.430 --> 03:53.940
You bastard.

03:54.010 --> 03:55.010
Get on your knees!

03:55.770 --> 03:56.310
Wait.

03:56.590 --> 03:57.840
Today, you should

03:58.190 --> 03:58.930
kneel

03:59.030 --> 04:00.160
inside this circle.

04:00.430 --> 04:01.630
Don't be mad. Well...

04:01.630 --> 04:02.840
Let me explain it in detail.

04:02.840 --> 04:03.750
Wait, Old Master Hu!

04:03.750 --> 04:05.120
Old Master Hu, please...

04:05.120 --> 04:06.180
Stay on your knees!

04:32.390 --> 04:33.100
Who are you?

04:33.310 --> 04:34.640
Where are you taking me?

04:59.070 --> 05:02.130
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:10.720 --> 05:11.480
Rise.

05:11.870 --> 05:13.680
Bring a seat for the Sixth Prince.

05:13.680 --> 05:15.080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

05:25.120 --> 05:27.290
I am Qiao Song, Governor of Anhui.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.480
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:31.630 --> 05:33.000
For your visit to Anhui this time,

05:33.000 --> 05:33.560
if you need

05:33.560 --> 05:35.159
anything else from the imperial court,

05:35.159 --> 05:37.290
you can tell the Sixth Prince about it.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.540
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:39.600 --> 05:41.240
The battle in Anhui is over.

05:41.560 --> 05:43.480
I will follow Marquis Zuo

05:43.510 --> 05:44.920
to reclaim the Northwest.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.240
Marquis Zuo wrote to me,

05:46.240 --> 05:47.560
asking me to purchase more foreign guns

05:47.560 --> 05:49.159
and cannons from the inland to strengthen

05:49.159 --> 05:50.310
our military supplies.

05:50.310 --> 05:50.950
However,

05:51.360 --> 05:53.950
it's extremely difficult to buy
even a single gun,

05:53.950 --> 05:56.810
and foreign gunpowder is
not easy to come by either.

05:59.040 --> 06:01.240
You can never trust
those foreigners when doing

06:01.240 --> 06:02.440
arms deals with them.

06:03.270 --> 06:04.400
Some days ago,

06:04.600 --> 06:06.600
a customs official told me

06:06.630 --> 06:07.270
that they bought

06:07.270 --> 06:08.800
a warship from a British man

06:09.000 --> 06:10.270
called Timothy.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.560
And guess what?

06:11.830 --> 06:13.410
They took our Qing Empire's money,

06:13.410 --> 06:15.600
yet they still insisted
on keeping control of the ship

06:15.600 --> 06:17.130
and only hired foreigners.

06:17.190 --> 06:17.880
Our people

06:17.920 --> 06:19.750
weren't even allowed to take a look at it.

06:19.750 --> 06:21.810
How could they do business like this?

06:22.750 --> 06:23.950
I already told Hart.

06:24.390 --> 06:26.240
Even if we have to give up the money,

06:26.240 --> 06:27.160
we must not let

06:27.160 --> 06:28.430
these untrustworthy foreigners

06:28.430 --> 06:30.800
walk all over us.

06:33.159 --> 06:34.960
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

06:35.510 --> 06:36.510
Timothy is no more

06:36.560 --> 06:38.720
than an unscrupulous British businessman.

06:38.720 --> 06:40.540
But if we let Mr. Hart

06:40.600 --> 06:42.730
go negotiate with the German captain,

06:43.159 --> 06:43.950
they would be

06:44.600 --> 06:46.120
willing to return the money.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.980
What's the use of getting it back?

06:48.360 --> 06:49.750
After all that hassle,

06:50.000 --> 06:51.460
we end up getting nothing.

06:51.870 --> 06:54.530
What's
the Office of General Management doing?

06:56.000 --> 06:57.750
Please forgive us, Your Majesty.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.800
Anyway, I failed

06:59.120 --> 07:00.070
in my duty.

07:03.510 --> 07:04.830
Rise, Sixth Prince.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.000
I'm not blaming you.

07:08.390 --> 07:09.920
About purchasing foreign firearms,

07:09.920 --> 07:11.800
go discuss it with Hart.

07:12.430 --> 07:14.750
If our forces
return defeated due to a lack

07:14.750 --> 07:16.510
of sufficient arms
to reclaim the Northwest,

07:16.510 --> 07:18.310
causing the imperial censors to lose it,

07:18.310 --> 07:19.970
I won't be able to protect you.

07:21.390 --> 07:22.600
Also, go ask

07:22.600 --> 07:24.870
those merchants who trade with foreigners

07:24.870 --> 07:26.330
to see if they can get some.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.530
Little by little, we'll get there.

07:33.360 --> 07:35.560
Let me go first when we talk to him later.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.210
Understood.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.120
Look at him.

07:45.159 --> 07:46.070
Mr. Hart.

07:47.100 --> 07:49.500
[Hart, Maritime Customs Service]

07:48.630 --> 07:49.480
Sixth Prince!

07:51.310 --> 07:52.040
Sup?

07:52.920 --> 07:53.750
Oh!

07:54.070 --> 07:56.070
You sound more like a local than I do!

07:58.720 --> 07:59.890
I just guessed

07:59.950 --> 08:01.530
you weren't at the government office

08:01.530 --> 08:03.330
and were chilling here instead.

08:05.070 --> 08:06.200
Come on, have a seat.

08:07.270 --> 08:07.920
Mr. Hart,

08:08.110 --> 08:10.120
I am the Governor of Anhui.

08:10.160 --> 08:10.800
Waiter!

08:11.560 --> 08:12.820
Two more premium ones.

08:13.750 --> 08:14.920
Coming!

08:16.070 --> 08:18.220
Our shop just got some Orchid Snow tea,

08:18.510 --> 08:19.910
the Top Tea Under Heaven.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.720
Mr. Hart, would you like to order some

08:21.720 --> 08:22.870
for your two friends?

08:22.870 --> 08:24.270
You're really ripping people off.

08:24.270 --> 08:25.160
Even the Empress Dowager

08:25.160 --> 08:26.120
only got 2 taels.

08:26.190 --> 08:26.790
Off you go.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.310
Cut it out.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.040
Yes, sir.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.520
Sixth Prince,

08:32.240 --> 08:34.039
where's the tea you promised me?

08:35.960 --> 08:36.960
I didn't fool you.

08:37.750 --> 08:38.750
This gentleman is

08:38.870 --> 08:40.600
the current Governor of Anhui,

08:40.669 --> 08:41.390
Qiao Song.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.000
He's in charge

08:43.240 --> 08:44.150
of all the Anhui tea.

08:44.150 --> 08:44.880
Yes, indeed.

08:44.910 --> 08:45.690
From now on,

08:45.790 --> 08:47.320
if you want Orchid Snow tea,

08:47.750 --> 08:48.950
just ask him about it.

08:49.930 --> 08:51.130
The Orchid Snow tea is

08:51.150 --> 08:52.510
going viral everywhere.

08:52.510 --> 08:54.440
My ears are tired of hearing about it.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.120
But

08:55.600 --> 08:57.260
I haven't had a single sip yet.

08:58.720 --> 08:59.790
Sorry for that.

09:00.030 --> 09:00.830
Sixth Prince,

09:01.440 --> 09:03.240
if you keep paying lip service,

09:04.150 --> 09:05.610
I won't be able to help you.

09:05.720 --> 09:06.630
Please don't.

09:07.960 --> 09:08.820
How about this?

09:11.320 --> 09:12.080
Well, I

09:12.750 --> 09:14.120
just requested 2 baskets of tea

09:14.120 --> 09:15.920
to offer to the Empress Dowager.

09:16.030 --> 09:17.490
Can't take more than that,

09:17.670 --> 09:19.000
but I can try to keep

09:19.000 --> 09:20.130
2 taels of it for you.

09:20.150 --> 09:21.280
There's no problem.

09:21.320 --> 09:23.000
I'll take care of it.

09:24.630 --> 09:25.120
Good.

09:26.960 --> 09:27.550
Mr. Qiao,

09:28.150 --> 09:29.610
go ahead with your matter.

09:30.720 --> 09:31.480
Mr. Hart,

09:31.870 --> 09:32.390
I,

09:32.390 --> 09:34.510
by order of the Empress Dowager,

09:35.150 --> 09:36.390
will go to the Northwest

09:36.390 --> 09:38.750
to reclaim our lost territories
after seizing Hefei.

09:38.750 --> 09:40.750
However, our guns and ammunition are

09:40.750 --> 09:41.880
in severe shortage.

09:42.120 --> 09:43.670
Could you please help us

09:43.910 --> 09:45.790
order some from Germany?

09:50.960 --> 09:53.000
The Office of General Management.

09:53.150 --> 09:54.610
sent this here yesterday.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.910
The capital's Tiger Spirit Battalion alone

09:56.290 --> 09:57.200
[1,000 guns with 200,000 bullets
for the capital's Tiger Spirit Battalion.]

09:58.120 --> 09:59.200
wants 1,000 guns

09:59.200 --> 10:00.790
with 200,000 bullets,

10:01.720 --> 10:03.790
20 breech-loading howitzers,

10:03.870 --> 10:05.120
and 50,000 shells.

10:05.550 --> 10:06.270
All these behind are

10:06.270 --> 10:08.000
orders from your provinces.

10:08.320 --> 10:09.000
You know,

10:10.200 --> 10:12.550
you must report
to the Office of General Management first

10:12.550 --> 10:13.550
before I can process it.

10:12.610 --> 10:13.480
[Order]

10:14.750 --> 10:15.720
Mr. Hart,

10:15.840 --> 10:17.870
please just spare 200 guns for me.

10:18.240 --> 10:19.600
The imperial court's
Tiger Spirit Battalion is

10:19.600 --> 10:20.320
guarding the capital.

10:20.320 --> 10:21.080
They won't need

10:21.080 --> 10:22.550
so many anytime soon.

10:23.750 --> 10:24.720
But I have to consider

10:24.720 --> 10:27.120
the first-come, first-served principle.

10:29.200 --> 10:31.000
I really can't wait for a year or more.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.360
I'll lose my position.

10:33.440 --> 10:35.840
Or how about we request
an imperial decree?

10:36.230 --> 10:38.120
No imperial edict can help.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.440
The Krupp foundry

10:39.440 --> 10:41.640
doesn't listen to the Empress Dowager.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.480
The earliest batch of firearms

10:43.480 --> 10:45.420
won't arrive until next spring.

10:45.630 --> 10:46.390
You'll have to

10:46.390 --> 10:48.790
go to Qingdao and collect them yourselves.

10:56.000 --> 10:56.510
Waiter!

10:59.960 --> 11:00.840
Mr. Hart.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.000
Here you are.

11:03.320 --> 11:05.050
Please help us figure out a way.

11:06.150 --> 11:07.080
I suggest you

11:08.550 --> 11:10.360
go talk to the God of Wealth.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.870
Businessmen are

11:12.440 --> 11:13.570
much more efficient

11:13.870 --> 11:16.730
than the imperial court
in handling these matters.

11:19.260 --> 11:20.680
The God of Wealth has

11:20.960 --> 11:23.000
plenty more people asking for favors.

11:23.000 --> 11:24.860
How could it possibly be my turn?

11:25.750 --> 11:27.270
Just recently, I finally managed

11:27.270 --> 11:28.800
to ask Gu Pingyuan for help.

11:29.030 --> 11:30.000
And guess what?

11:31.240 --> 11:32.840
He's gone missing!

11:33.560 --> 11:34.270
Old Master Hu,

11:34.270 --> 11:36.150
let me go find Gu Pingyuan!

11:38.840 --> 11:40.480
There's no use doing it that way.

11:40.480 --> 11:41.360
What's the point of you

11:41.360 --> 11:42.690
getting bad in the room?

11:42.720 --> 11:44.520
Straighten it up before moving.

11:45.000 --> 11:46.330
Everyone, take it slow.

11:46.840 --> 11:48.270
Place the boxes against the wall

11:48.270 --> 11:49.870
and arrange them in proper order.

11:49.870 --> 11:50.790
Old Master Hu,

11:51.440 --> 11:53.760
please let me go find Gu Pingyuan.

11:54.030 --> 11:54.480
Old Master Hu!

11:54.480 --> 11:56.030
Let me go look for Gu Pingyuan!

11:56.030 --> 11:57.360
-I'll get Gu Pingyuan back for you!
-Which Gu Pingyuan?

11:57.360 --> 11:58.120
Okay?

12:00.200 --> 12:02.460
Which Gu Pingyuan are you talking about?

12:02.750 --> 12:04.280
What's it got to do with you?

12:05.320 --> 12:07.000
Is it the Gu Pingyuan from Anhui?

12:07.000 --> 12:08.270
A tall, young man?

12:10.150 --> 12:11.080
You've seen him?

12:12.630 --> 12:13.440
My dear lady,

12:13.480 --> 12:14.390
please! Please tell me

12:14.390 --> 12:15.480
where Gu Pingyuan is, will you?

12:15.480 --> 12:16.480
Please tell me...

12:16.550 --> 12:18.210
Did he really come to Beijing?

12:18.470 --> 12:18.800
Wait,

12:19.240 --> 12:20.360
you don't know that?

12:20.360 --> 12:21.510
Then why are you messing around here?

12:21.510 --> 12:22.080
Off you go.

12:22.080 --> 12:22.790
Old Master Hu!

12:22.790 --> 12:24.510
Someone is here to visit Mr. Gu Pingyuan!

12:24.510 --> 12:26.030
Who? Who is it?

12:26.120 --> 12:27.840
Why is everyone looking for Gu Pingyuan?

12:27.840 --> 12:29.630
Are you looking for Gu Pingyuan?

12:29.630 --> 12:31.550
Greetings, Old Master Hu.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.480
Isn't this Li Wantang's son,

12:34.480 --> 12:35.270
young Mr. Li?

12:35.360 --> 12:35.960
Well...

12:36.030 --> 12:36.760
Yes, it's me.

12:36.870 --> 12:38.670
Do you know where Gu Pingyuan is?

12:43.670 --> 12:45.090
Look at the trouble you've caused!

12:45.090 --> 12:45.910
What are you doing?

12:45.910 --> 12:47.970
Everyone's looking for Gu Pingyuan!

13:21.510 --> 13:22.840
Do you know where we are?

13:47.150 --> 13:47.910
Ningguta.

14:11.960 --> 14:12.760
Commander Xu,

14:13.670 --> 14:14.670
how have you been?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.550
I asked his brother.

14:36.630 --> 14:37.840
He said they sent that man surnamed Hou

14:37.840 --> 14:38.440
to rent a carriage

14:38.440 --> 14:40.440
with the Thirteen Great Guardians
to pick him up.

14:40.440 --> 14:42.340
And he passed out
after drinking a cup of tea.

14:42.340 --> 14:43.360
When he woke up,

14:43.750 --> 14:46.150
both the people
and the carriage were gone.

14:46.750 --> 14:49.120
Did he antagonize someone?

14:50.120 --> 14:51.840
Or was he kidnapped by bandits?

14:51.840 --> 14:54.500
But there should have been
some kind of message.

14:54.910 --> 14:55.670
I need to find him.

14:55.670 --> 14:57.670
Where would you even start looking?

14:57.790 --> 15:00.000
The Tea Merchants' Association offered
tens of thousands of taels

15:00.000 --> 15:01.200
of silver as a reward.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.030
So many people have
searched for him but failed.

15:03.030 --> 15:03.790
North, south, east, or west,

15:03.790 --> 15:05.990
at least you need to know the direction.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.960
Come with me
to ask the major escort agencies

15:12.960 --> 15:14.290
in the capital about it.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.750
They're on the way every day,

15:17.390 --> 15:19.320
so they might have seen something.

17:15.310 --> 17:17.069
Your stomach is full of ice.

17:17.440 --> 17:20.900
If you get near the fire,
your internal organs will be damaged.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.200
Don't worry.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.510
Two hours later,

17:26.680 --> 17:28.280
I'll take you outside again.

17:29.160 --> 17:30.690
Before you freeze to death,

17:30.920 --> 17:32.850
I'll definitely bring you back in.

17:36.510 --> 17:37.440
Comfortable?

17:46.720 --> 17:47.750
Want to sleep?

17:48.790 --> 17:49.840
No way.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.200
If you're asleep, who else can I talk to?

17:55.440 --> 17:56.680
If you want to sleep now, I'll just

17:56.680 --> 17:58.110
take you outside to cool off again.

17:58.110 --> 18:00.070
Wait! Hear me out. Wait.

18:01.790 --> 18:02.550
You're just

18:03.200 --> 18:05.260
trying to torture me a little longer.

18:05.750 --> 18:07.030
If I freeze to death,

18:08.790 --> 18:11.190
who will
keep you company in this game? Huh?

18:11.750 --> 18:13.150
You need to keep me alive.

18:13.960 --> 18:15.700
I'm starving right now.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.910
Give me something to eat.

18:18.640 --> 18:19.440
Please.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.550
Have some wine.

19:27.480 --> 19:29.740
It's been quite a while since you escaped

19:31.640 --> 19:33.880
to lead that dreamlike life,

19:35.510 --> 19:37.480
and now you've finally woken up.

19:38.790 --> 19:39.650
Was it worth it?

19:47.750 --> 19:48.310
Yes.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.470
Absolutely worth it.

19:51.830 --> 19:53.160
The places I've been are

19:54.000 --> 19:55.790
somewhere you'll never reach
in your lifetime.

19:55.790 --> 19:57.650
Are there places more prosperous

19:57.720 --> 19:59.300
than Fengtian?

20:02.270 --> 20:03.000
Fengtian.

20:04.640 --> 20:05.200
So that is

20:05.240 --> 20:07.840
the best place
you've ever been to in your life.

20:08.480 --> 20:09.940
After I escaped from here,

20:10.790 --> 20:12.390
I went to the vast grassland.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.030
There,

20:14.680 --> 20:16.270
tens of thousands of herdsmen

20:16.270 --> 20:18.260
fought against each other

20:18.550 --> 20:20.080
for a stretch of grassland.

20:26.960 --> 20:27.920
Later,

20:28.880 --> 20:29.310
I went

20:29.310 --> 20:31.910
to Shanxi,
where the world's wealth gathered.

20:32.350 --> 20:33.110
There,

20:34.440 --> 20:35.070
I saw

20:35.070 --> 20:37.200
giant Buddha statues
and the Eighteen Arhats

20:37.200 --> 20:38.400
made of pure gold.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.720
Their eyes

20:41.310 --> 20:42.240
and clothes were

20:43.070 --> 20:44.790
all inlaid with huge gems.

20:48.150 --> 20:48.920
Next,

20:50.200 --> 20:51.530
I returned to Jiangnan.

20:52.310 --> 20:53.270
That place was awash

20:53.270 --> 20:54.530
with beautiful women.

21:04.830 --> 21:06.030
I even went to Beijing

21:06.880 --> 21:08.540
and saw Empress Dowager Cixi.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.060
She drank our Orchid Snow tea.

21:18.030 --> 21:19.050
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

21:21.100 --> 21:23.780
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

21:34.400 --> 21:36.060
Go ahead and brag all you want.

21:37.270 --> 21:40.400
Aren't you afraid that you might
strain your tongue with all that hot air?

21:40.400 --> 21:41.240
I never brag.

21:42.790 --> 21:43.650
What about you?

21:44.270 --> 21:46.400
How have you been these past two years?

21:50.920 --> 21:51.640
Me?

21:54.270 --> 21:56.310
Thanks to you,

21:57.750 --> 21:59.680
I'm here managing this horse camp.

22:01.030 --> 22:03.490
There are 9 months
of winter here every year.

22:03.830 --> 22:05.360
I've been living like a rat,

22:05.720 --> 22:08.050
feeding on the meat of frozen dead horses.

22:40.480 --> 22:42.140
Judging from your condition,

22:42.440 --> 22:44.240
I doubt you'll last much longer.

22:49.310 --> 22:50.270
Don't worry.

22:51.160 --> 22:54.030
I'll live long enough to see you die.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.240
Wait.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.900
Let's have a good talk.

23:00.060 --> 23:02.640
For all the suffering
you've endured these years,

23:02.640 --> 23:04.170
I can pay to compensate you.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.720
In this godforsaken place,

23:12.600 --> 23:15.000
even if you offer me
mountains of gold and silver,

23:15.000 --> 23:17.030
it would be useless to me.

23:21.590 --> 23:22.120
Let's go!

23:22.550 --> 23:23.880
Let's go outside to cool off!

23:23.880 --> 23:24.270
No.

23:25.000 --> 23:25.480
Stop!

23:25.580 --> 23:26.750
Let's talk! Don't!

23:27.310 --> 23:28.310
I'm not leaving!

23:28.680 --> 23:30.010
I'm staying right here.

23:35.830 --> 23:36.640
No! Don't shoot me!

23:36.640 --> 23:38.840
Move one more inch and see what happens!

23:40.270 --> 23:40.790
Wait.

23:43.310 --> 23:44.510
This is a foreign gun.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.350
A breech-loading model, right?

23:47.350 --> 23:49.010
This place is close to Russia.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.030
You bought it from the people

23:50.030 --> 23:51.270
who came from there, right?

23:51.270 --> 23:52.640
You talk too much.

23:53.030 --> 23:54.070
If you can trade with them,

23:54.070 --> 23:55.750
why can't you do business with me?

23:55.750 --> 23:56.770
If you stay and work here forever,

23:56.770 --> 23:58.270
you'll never be
more than a battalion commander,

23:58.270 --> 24:00.330
a nobody with an insignificant rank!

24:02.200 --> 24:03.600
Have you ever considered

24:03.830 --> 24:05.480
that you could be a guerrilla leader,

24:05.480 --> 24:06.480
or even a general?

24:06.510 --> 24:08.170
I'll be the one who screws you!

24:08.200 --> 24:09.070
Okay! Whatever!

24:09.070 --> 24:10.730
But do you want to be a general?

24:17.240 --> 24:17.970
Listen to me.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.750
The imperial court is now

24:20.800 --> 24:22.800
planning to reclaim the Northwest.

24:23.420 --> 24:26.430
They need to purchase
a large quantity of arms,

24:26.640 --> 24:29.170
exactly like the foreign gun
you're holding.

24:29.270 --> 24:30.320
If you've got a source for them,

24:30.320 --> 24:31.520
we can work together.

24:31.640 --> 24:32.770
Let's collaborate!

24:39.240 --> 24:40.030
I traded

24:40.440 --> 24:42.240
four wolf pelts for this gun.

24:43.270 --> 24:45.200
How many guns
would I need to become a general?

24:45.200 --> 24:46.200
Several hundred.

24:46.830 --> 24:47.960
The more the better.

24:49.310 --> 24:50.040
I have money.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.170
I have plenty of it.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.160
Xu.

24:56.920 --> 24:57.550
Xu!

24:58.920 --> 25:00.450
Let's talk again, shall we?

25:00.550 --> 25:01.480
Please!

25:02.160 --> 25:03.240
Please!

25:04.790 --> 25:05.510
Xu!

25:05.680 --> 25:06.920
Let go of me!

25:07.720 --> 25:08.720
Xu!

25:08.830 --> 25:10.690
If you have the guts, just kill me!

25:11.680 --> 25:12.590
Kill me!

25:13.310 --> 25:14.350
Xu!

25:17.350 --> 25:18.270
Xu!

25:19.270 --> 25:20.160
Xu!

25:21.200 --> 25:22.350
Please let me go.

26:31.680 --> 26:56.830
♪ This year sees
the most enchanting spring ♪

26:56.960 --> 26:58.150
Is Ms. Su inside?

26:58.400 --> 26:58.910
Hey,

26:58.960 --> 27:00.300
why won't you let me in?

27:01.350 --> 27:01.960
What is she busy with?

27:01.960 --> 27:02.920
There's an opera performance inside.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.770
She can't be busy!

27:03.770 --> 27:04.770
Ms. Su!

27:04.960 --> 27:05.880
Ms. Su!

27:06.110 --> 27:07.680
I need to speak with you!

27:08.440 --> 27:09.310
Ms. Su!

27:09.790 --> 27:11.180
-You may leave.
-It's urgent!

27:11.180 --> 27:12.400
Just let me in!

27:13.680 --> 27:15.410
Stop making a scene. Let him in.

27:21.720 --> 27:23.180
Welcome, Young Master Li.

27:24.030 --> 27:25.230
What brings you here?

27:28.310 --> 27:30.170
Where have you taken Gu Pingyuan?

27:38.350 --> 27:39.480
I know who you are.

27:51.880 --> 27:52.790
Who am I?

28:05.350 --> 28:06.790
You were humiliated in Pingyao.

28:06.790 --> 28:08.430
Isn't he your enemy?

28:08.460 --> 28:10.510
Since when have you been
on good terms with him?

28:10.510 --> 28:11.960
I also don't know why,

28:12.070 --> 28:13.790
but I am worried about him.

28:15.480 --> 28:17.110
You should worry about yourself

28:17.110 --> 28:18.160
and your father.

28:18.590 --> 28:19.310
Do you really think

28:19.310 --> 28:20.640
being Li Wantang's son

28:20.720 --> 28:22.320
means you're safe and sound?

28:22.550 --> 28:23.750
This enormous wealth

28:23.790 --> 28:25.200
and overwhelming power

28:25.310 --> 28:27.030
can vanish overnight.

28:28.790 --> 28:29.880
Just tell me

28:29.880 --> 28:31.210
where he is. That's all.

28:33.160 --> 28:34.490
You really want to know?

28:34.550 --> 28:34.920
I...

28:35.880 --> 28:36.880
Don't answer yet.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.140
I'll ask you three questions.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.680
After that, if you still want to know,

28:40.680 --> 28:42.540
I'll keep my promise and tell you.

28:46.160 --> 28:46.750
This man

28:46.790 --> 28:49.050
ruined the big plan of your father and me.

28:51.830 --> 28:53.490
Do you really want to save him?

28:54.070 --> 28:54.600
Yes, I do.

28:54.830 --> 28:55.640
Are you curious

28:55.640 --> 28:57.500
about what kind of big plan it was?

29:08.590 --> 29:09.320
Listen to me.

29:10.790 --> 29:12.320
If we collect a cart of guns,

29:12.640 --> 29:14.570
we can sell them and make a fortune.

29:15.110 --> 29:16.840
You need to become an official.

29:16.920 --> 29:18.920
Otherwise, money is useless to you.

29:19.640 --> 29:20.480
We'll get

29:21.200 --> 29:22.260
as much as you need.

29:24.350 --> 29:25.950
It's between just you and me.

29:42.480 --> 29:45.480
I was also there
at the Grand Tea Competition that day.

29:45.920 --> 29:48.050
I knew the Empress Dowager would come.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.710
I prepared a cup of poisoned tea for her,

29:50.790 --> 29:52.350
but Gu ruined it.

29:55.000 --> 29:56.480
Such an extremely rare opportunity was

29:56.480 --> 29:57.740
just wasted like that.

29:58.640 --> 30:00.480
The chance of finding
another opportunity like this is

30:00.480 --> 30:01.680
almost zero.

30:05.640 --> 30:06.550
If you save him,

30:07.000 --> 30:08.730
you'll be making an enemy of me.

30:08.790 --> 30:10.350
Now that you've heard what I've done,

30:10.350 --> 30:12.350
you share half the responsibility.

30:14.160 --> 30:15.310
If you save his life,

30:15.960 --> 30:16.960
you'll be an accomplice.

30:16.960 --> 30:18.760
You can't stay out of it anymore.

30:20.000 --> 30:22.110
Usurpation leads to punishment
more than just beheading.

30:22.110 --> 30:24.930
The entire clan will be
sentenced to death by slicing.

30:24.930 --> 30:26.530
Do you still want to save him?

30:35.350 --> 30:36.680
I must save him.

30:39.280 --> 30:41.140
You really don't get it.

30:41.350 --> 30:43.000
If that woman dies,

30:43.110 --> 30:45.270
the Sixth Prince
can immediately become regent,

30:45.270 --> 30:48.070
promoting commerce
and expanding diplomatic relations.

30:48.070 --> 30:48.960
When that happens,

30:48.960 --> 30:50.480
who do you think will oversee

30:50.480 --> 30:51.880
all commercial affairs?

30:52.830 --> 30:53.690
If you save him,

30:53.830 --> 30:56.830
you'll get in the way
of your father's rising to power.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.580
Do you really want to save him?

31:02.880 --> 31:04.610
These big issues you mentioned

31:05.240 --> 31:06.240
don't concern me.

31:07.110 --> 31:08.160
All I know is

31:08.830 --> 31:10.480
that he's my only friend.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.290
I must save him.

31:13.400 --> 31:14.310
If Gu Pingyuan dies,

31:14.310 --> 31:16.040
everyone will have some peace.

31:16.350 --> 31:18.550
You're the only one who cares about him.

31:18.920 --> 31:19.680
This man

31:19.880 --> 31:22.000
has got brains and tricks way better

31:22.040 --> 31:22.880
than yours.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.480
He's no ordinary man for sure.

31:24.480 --> 31:25.400
Once he gets the upper hand,

31:25.400 --> 31:26.860
you'll be no match for him.

31:27.680 --> 31:29.680
Do you want to keep an enemy for yourself?

31:29.680 --> 31:30.680
Do you want to let someone

31:30.680 --> 31:31.400
who outdoes you

31:31.400 --> 31:33.330
in every way survive in this world?

31:34.160 --> 31:35.760
Do you still want to save him?

31:38.070 --> 31:38.880
Answer me.

31:51.440 --> 31:52.030
Mr. Li.

31:52.160 --> 31:52.890
Who's there?

31:53.310 --> 31:53.980
You're Mr. Li Qin,

31:53.980 --> 31:55.960
son of Li Million in Beijing, right?

31:55.960 --> 31:57.290
We met in Shanxi before.

31:59.030 --> 32:01.030
I've been looking everywhere for Mr. Gu.

32:01.030 --> 32:02.290
Do you know where he is?

32:02.550 --> 32:04.150
You've got the wrong person.

32:06.640 --> 32:07.040
You...

32:08.310 --> 32:08.970
And you are?

32:09.270 --> 32:10.240
I'm Chang Yu'er.

32:10.880 --> 32:12.280
My father is Mr. Chang Si.

32:12.590 --> 32:13.720
We came
from the Tea Merchants' Association

32:13.720 --> 32:15.120
in Shanxi with our goods.

32:15.720 --> 32:16.200
I...

32:17.510 --> 32:18.440
I want to see him.

32:21.400 --> 32:22.440
Can I trust you?

32:24.240 --> 32:25.160
You know

32:25.550 --> 32:26.510
how he risked his life

32:26.510 --> 32:27.830
to save my father.

32:29.790 --> 32:31.120
I don't know where he is.

32:32.070 --> 32:32.800
Just tell me.

32:34.640 --> 32:36.100
What if he's already dead?

32:39.240 --> 32:40.630
If he were dead,

32:41.790 --> 32:43.590
he would have said goodbye to me.

32:44.030 --> 32:45.490
I haven't dreamed of that.

32:50.160 --> 32:52.360
Since you put it that way, I believe you.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.620
He's in a place of bitter cold.

34:00.070 --> 34:00.880
In the past few years,

34:00.880 --> 34:03.070
these wolf cubs have bullied me a lot.

34:03.880 --> 34:06.240
Before I leave, I need to tell them

34:06.480 --> 34:08.230
that I'm going to be a general.

34:30.190 --> 34:31.030
Do the Russians live

34:31.030 --> 34:31.830
far from here?

34:32.280 --> 34:33.840
Cross the Argun River

34:34.190 --> 34:35.440
and head further north,

34:35.440 --> 34:36.370
and that's where

34:36.510 --> 34:38.440
the Cossack cavalry is stationed.

34:38.760 --> 34:41.290
That's a trading area
between the two states.

34:47.880 --> 34:49.440
Grilled meat! Come take a look!

34:49.440 --> 34:50.440
Fresh meat!

34:50.440 --> 34:51.510
Grilled meat! Check this out!

34:51.510 --> 34:53.920
Fresh meat! Fresh meat for sale!

34:53.920 --> 34:56.320
Grilled meat! Come take a look!

34:56.480 --> 34:58.280
Great prices!

34:58.440 --> 35:00.070
Come and take a look!

35:00.280 --> 35:02.960
Come check out the fresh lamb!

35:03.280 --> 35:07.840
Freshly butchered lamb legs! Take a look!

35:13.550 --> 35:14.760
Here's some nice stuff!

35:14.760 --> 35:17.280
The freshest meat! Come on!

35:17.880 --> 35:19.590
It's cheap.

35:20.110 --> 35:21.550
This is called Shashlik.

35:21.880 --> 35:23.150
It's local grilled meat.

35:23.150 --> 35:24.360
Bigger piece! Bigger!

35:24.360 --> 35:24.800
Here.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.920
Try it. Very delicious!

35:27.400 --> 35:28.670
Thank you very much.

35:28.800 --> 35:30.060
Bigger piece! Bigger!

35:53.960 --> 35:54.880
Handsome guy.

35:56.030 --> 35:57.800
Come on, let's dance.

35:59.880 --> 36:00.800
Look.

36:01.440 --> 36:03.440
Who's this guy from the Qing Empire?

36:32.470 --> 36:34.330
Are we going to buy guns from them?

36:38.230 --> 36:38.920
Excuse me.

36:39.360 --> 36:41.290
Excuse me. Let me through, please.

36:42.280 --> 36:43.030
What are you doing?

36:43.030 --> 36:43.590
Sorry.

36:43.670 --> 36:44.480
Get lost.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.110
Get out of here.

36:48.110 --> 36:49.230
Shoot! They have a gun!

36:49.230 --> 36:50.490
Don't let them escape!

36:51.400 --> 36:53.670
After them! Let's go!

37:03.520 --> 37:04.700
[Good Weather]

37:17.480 --> 37:18.510
Why did you run around like that?

37:18.510 --> 37:19.150
How would I know

37:19.150 --> 37:20.210
what that place is?

37:20.440 --> 37:21.710
Tie yourself to the horse!

37:21.710 --> 37:23.070
We're hitting the road tonight!

37:23.070 --> 37:23.920
Were it not for me,

37:23.920 --> 37:26.050
they would have eaten you alive by now.

38:29.150 --> 38:30.880
How can you still laugh
on the brink of death?

38:30.880 --> 38:32.590
Karma finally caught up with you.

38:32.590 --> 38:33.850
Now you know how I felt.

38:39.920 --> 38:40.480
Get out.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.480
Are you Tartars?

38:47.920 --> 38:48.850
The Qing Empire.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.410
We're from the Qing Empire!

38:52.800 --> 38:53.660
I'm a merchant.

38:53.840 --> 38:54.440
I am

38:55.000 --> 38:56.400
a merchant doing business.

38:56.400 --> 38:57.530
I have a lot of money!

39:06.440 --> 39:07.900
Let me see what you've got.

39:11.710 --> 39:12.440
Boots!

39:12.840 --> 39:14.150
In the b-boots.

39:22.150 --> 39:23.320
You cunning man.

39:33.030 --> 39:33.890
Do you have any?

39:39.110 --> 39:40.030
I have boots.

39:43.280 --> 39:44.030
Guards!

39:45.960 --> 39:47.020
Take this man away.

39:53.590 --> 39:54.320
Gu Pingyuan!

39:56.920 --> 39:57.650
Gu Pingyuan!

39:58.400 --> 39:59.660
Ask them not to kill me!

39:59.880 --> 40:00.880
Tell them not to kill me!

40:00.880 --> 40:01.800
No, no! We're together!

40:01.800 --> 40:03.030
We're both merchants!

40:03.030 --> 40:04.590
-Business partners!
-Partners!

40:04.590 --> 40:05.510
Hold on.

40:05.710 --> 40:06.570
Bring him back.

40:12.840 --> 40:13.710
W-We are

40:14.110 --> 40:15.240
business partners.

40:16.150 --> 40:16.800
Buy guns.

40:17.760 --> 40:18.820
We want to buy guns!

40:20.320 --> 40:21.360
Buy guns!

40:23.550 --> 40:25.230
Haven't you done business with him before?

40:25.230 --> 40:26.430
How do you say "guns"?

40:44.800 --> 40:45.400
Guns.

40:47.670 --> 40:48.360
Guns!

40:51.320 --> 40:52.070
Did he get it?

40:52.510 --> 40:53.440
How would I know?

40:53.880 --> 40:54.510
I bought my gun

40:54.510 --> 40:55.710
from another hunter.

40:56.030 --> 40:56.630
I've never dealt

40:56.630 --> 40:57.760
with them directly.

40:58.960 --> 41:00.690
You've really screwed us over.

41:01.030 --> 41:01.630
They're going to make us

41:01.630 --> 41:03.360
into Shashlik (grilled meat).

41:19.150 --> 41:19.670
No!

41:20.000 --> 41:20.700
No, no, no.

41:20.720 --> 41:21.500
No, no, no.

41:21.530 --> 41:22.190
No, no, no.

41:22.230 --> 41:23.110
No, no, no.

41:35.110 --> 41:36.240
It's not expensive.

41:44.360 --> 41:45.510
So he got it.

42:09.190 --> 42:10.920
The Governor of Anhui, Qiao Song, told me

42:10.920 --> 42:11.670
that they bought guns

42:11.670 --> 42:12.940
at 16 taels of silver each.

42:12.940 --> 42:14.630
We only need to pay
3 taels of silver for each.

42:14.630 --> 42:16.360
This is a real bargain.

42:17.070 --> 42:19.180
You're buying over 100 guns at once.

42:19.630 --> 42:20.880
How will you take them back?

42:20.880 --> 42:21.760
We have money.

42:23.000 --> 42:24.320
We can buy a huge cart

42:24.400 --> 42:25.880
and use horses to transport them back.

42:25.880 --> 42:27.070
Once we reach
the military station in Ningguta,

42:27.070 --> 42:28.070
everything will be easy.

42:28.070 --> 42:28.800
I have the permit issued

42:28.800 --> 42:30.800
by the imperial court to purchase guns.

42:30.800 --> 42:31.590
As long as you're telling

42:31.590 --> 42:33.670
the truth about the imperial court's plan
to buy guns.

42:33.670 --> 42:34.300
Come on,

42:34.480 --> 42:35.550
just rest assured.

42:36.190 --> 42:37.320
You got it this time.

42:37.550 --> 42:38.630
You can gain an official position

42:38.630 --> 42:39.760
and make money, too.

42:40.360 --> 42:41.400
Nobility for generations

42:41.400 --> 42:42.730
and wealth till old age.

42:43.360 --> 42:44.400
Let's call it even between us.
